            "notes": "# Season 17 Updates\n**[S17 UPDATE]**: From my experience testing this build in the current (at the time of writing this) season, there is potential merit in running [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) as your R1 power. Running Precarious Potency will help with credit generation in the early-game, allowing you to quickly get the items you need by R3 and pick Multiball. By doing this, you're essentially switching your R1 and R5/7 powers.\n\n# Round 1 Power\n[Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) will be your first Power.\n\nYou may think about choosing [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560), but in the early rounds, Cross-Orbal tends to perform better. You'll pick Multiball later.\n\n# Round 1 Items\nRealistically, the MAIN item you need to get is  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). Everything else here is purely up to how you want to play in the early game.\n\nI typically run [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), and pick a third item based on context (enemy team comp, my team comp, what I want to get in the moment, etc.)",
