            "notes": "# Round 2 Items\n [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be): One of the strongest perks for Orb-focused Moira builds.\n\n [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6): Good early-game AP for your orbs/ultimate.\n\n## What if I can't afford Smart Orbs & Nano Cola?\nIf selling one green item will get you these two items, sell it and buy the two items.\n\nIf you can't afford both without selling 2 or more items, pick up [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) first. Pick up [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) in Round 3. Fill with other blues and greens.\n\n## What about purples?\nIf you're able to purchase Smart Orbs & Nano Cola all in round two, you're already in a good spot.  I generally wouldn't recommend skipping these two items for a purple at this stage - or ever. If you earn high credits, you'll be able to purchase purples in Round 3.\nYou won't be able to purchase both Smart Orbs and a purple item, so take that into consideration.\n\nIf you absolutely want to buy a purple item in Round 2, here are some you can consider:\n\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4): If you've been using your ult and want it to charge faster, grab this.\n- [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8): I actually wouldn't ever buy this round 2, but if you want to, go ahead.\n- [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98): Good (and necessary in the final build) to slow the enemy team, keep them clumped together, or to chase down low-health enemies.\n- [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505): If their team comp naturally has healers, or if your enemy is building lifesteal, that you want to debuff early: [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da), [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457), [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546)",
