            "created_at": "2025-07-07T23:17:18.615628+00:00",
            "notes": "# Round 3 Powers\nFor round 3, you'll want to pick up [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) now. Your usefulness as a Utility Moira\u2122 will start becoming apparent now.\n\n## Substitute Powers\nIn most cases, you should never pick any other power over Multiball. Your optional powers will come during Rounds 5 & 7 based on the flow of your specific game.\nCheck the notes at the top of this guide to see optional powers you can pick from based on your potential needs.\n\n# Round 3 Items\nThis is where you start buying purple items. Your goal is to build [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) as fast as possible so you can become Utility Moira\u2122, but depending on the match's situation, you could pick up the following:\n- [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98): As stated earlier, helps with orb upkeep on enemies, keeps them clumped together, or to chase down low-health heroes. You will pick this eventually, but if you want this over Cybervenom now, buy it.\n- [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8): Your orbs will work at farther ranges from their target, triggering all of your utility (smart orbs, cybervenom, liquid nitrogen, etc.) at greater distances.\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): Raw AP output. Greatly increases orb healing and damage. This is a viable pickup round 3/4 if you're doing well. I recommend this as part of your final build.\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4): For more ult uses per round. Goes really well with [Coalegion](item_ff9adeb1-362c-46a4-80ef-4e0eb07479cc).\n- [Coalegion](item_ff9adeb1-362c-46a4-80ef-4e0eb07479cc): I wouldn't get this without [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) mainly because you most likely won't be able to use your ult more than once in the early rounds. If you are, then this is a good substitute pick.\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b): Special thanks to Yunec for pointing out this item! This is a good pick in-between to generate more AP if you don't run Champion's Kit.\n\nDo **NOT** sell Smart Orbs to buy more purple items or your first purple item. If you have to go [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) and [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), do that first. But typically, you should have these in round two and starting buying purples in round 3 unless you and/or your team did not win/get enough points to buy a purple. In this case, pick situational blue items.",
