            "notes": "# Round 4 Items\nBy this round, you should have your MAIN utility items: [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). \n\nWith these two items, you now slow enemies and reduce healing by 30%. With [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be), enemies should be debuffed for a good chunk of time, which will be expanded further with [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8).\n\nIf you can't afford a second purple at this stage, pick up a blue item that best fits your situation. Check the \"Optional Items\" for recommendations.",
